Version 2.0.

repro/run-unit-repro.sh checks out the upstream tags and pull-request commits
listed in the README and runs their tests. repro/mk_test.py copies the body of
upstream TestFairPreemptions (pkg/scheduler/preemption/preemption_fair_test.go)
and swaps in the scenarios in repro/article_a_cases.go.txt. The generated file
keeps Kueue's Apache-2.0 copyright header. It is written into a temporary
git worktree under ${WORK:-/tmp/kueue-article-a} and is not committed here.

The queue manifests, job template, share-mapping tests, and scenario case text
in this repository are original to this repro. They call Kueue's public test
helpers when the harness is compiled inside a Kueue worktree.
